{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1489,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a83033208a09bb390834228d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯……提不起干劲……\r\n明明都已经用超冰的水\r\n洗过脸了……嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfd1183de4f99ceb1248b96d53f88d211d0a36004d079f45775c633ef3affc68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:414996778272b99e23cdc25c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……可恶，身体不听使唤。\r\n内心火苗也很微弱……不行不行，\r\n怎么能受这些小事影响……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2295531b4e2ef54131c0aa95edf822da740a0f5c95a1f322cd5ae5e59c92965a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d46824c95dd8539774019617",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………啊，别误会！\r\n刚刚我不是在装死啦……\r\n只是发呆了一下……",
      "source_fingerprint": "59aad1133409f765e639aa52e7049853542f1f117e5404a5e8be39fbac815499",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bceaa83c84e00def77c77f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂喂，又要比赛啊！？\r\n我知道你很有干劲啦……\r\n但我可不想太乱来喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f0a7a2eb718bdb8bfa30bae701458d4fa6d6826fe226bb0f7d9fd608b457cb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23684b493330baad2b2ac1d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，你是不是太焦急啦？\r\n努力可不等于乱来喔。\r\n听好了，严禁乱来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee523124949a3f31a49b3ff1b3d45a69515f799b94b8ad8440b95edcef082b6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11822efaee00bc458a32ca1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情绝佳！\r\n出发吧，我要让所有人见识到\r\n将赢得今天比赛的王牌跑法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f613c478e4f9d852f0376312239d79b663535a27359cb48ed1f268709b10e18a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed5f020180a1d1f2d4b2ff11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一股无与伦比的力量\r\n在我体内涌现了出来……！\r\n我这就去向众人展现王牌的背影啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f14d6177a220e3e9acf5450194dc1917366fe8808c22dd9c1f6b5821ed0516ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:263fe6c3603ef142a14d3b20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论对手有多强我都求之不得！\r\n肉体和心灵都在熊熊燃烧……\r\n让我恨不得立刻就大显身手一番！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7daa9ad42e8af9910182216faafa93fe716796b578b6d8c57c514a95e7fc6f26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0665a81d01d4d2296dd9aa18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态调整得很好！\r\n接下来就只待释放这股\r\n沸腾已久的斗志了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddf6271349cf24c134749617433a5e523de888e17e63266e806a71ae174b1096",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e1536678564db75a552f29b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态很棒！\r\n再来就去找今天的对手们打招呼吧！\r\n我要告诉她们来场燃烧灵魂的对决！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63d7774fd04dff13fb44a34dfb7836670b193af1d3b2a51b1ebd1d4d4dc06e14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb046e58618a2ed354f8b342",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚采访时，\r\n记者问了我的状态跟抱负。\r\n我回答状态很好，敬请期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90efbe82149b953628d565eadefca641460198d023595fdca62c9ff84f780e73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdb9d655feaf6595d16f4aaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状况算是普普通通吧。\r\n别担心，很快就会燃起斗志了。\r\n待会见啦，搭档！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a73e7fb97fc47cc70c46248b9fe2097d24386a4a00d34596768524a6ad1a3e02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:765126f361686a37ddb689fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态调整得不好也不坏……\r\n算了，大概就这样吧。\r\n好～我去热身一下啦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "53ddf349be39fda650e88160a629c24172bf924456fd45cec0e1121e14e3aa23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18987078dd874883d0c8cf4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得心情普普通通。\r\n好，训练员！\r\n用力拍打我的背帮我打气吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1d9b09c6695092783fe1e3cd1026f5470a614397f3a02bccfe0e94579fa0a87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f46f1d74a1fd88f0ad749b3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算状态偏向不佳啊……\r\n我也要跑出足以将劣势打飞的\r\n炙热表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b15fb9f5c91ec8ba3df4f60296ba71f61140982fc0077ec1fda50cc44a89394",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d7621015c552ca5027ee9f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哦哦哦！状态不佳也正合我意！\r\n只要能拿出……意志力……可恶，\r\n总觉得没办法完全发挥出气势……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51edfa254a279710260d845f44c381f059ab163584919adbdcb2453b3bc469aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da2b4e59e0df9a2ae203a1e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是我事前更用心调整一点……\r\n不行不行，专心专心！\r\n别去乱想些没有王牌风范的事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f86a81b7f04526b4d5d0fc54dc2234efcb2be47d2f0671f3fe0928d9993500da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6777d06cf290be304a5c38ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论身处在逆境还是危机中……\r\n身为王牌的我，\r\n有些事绝对不能妥协……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7a52de8dca59c13e64b639593361802a2bc27f0966a89a4b879d12edf83cac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b74cc80be46b948093cc03cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算此刻的心情糟糕透顶，\r\n也不代表开始比赛后不会好转……\r\n所以……我要上场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc475d5a6ba561e992686b9600c665e65ea785e7301a9ae781a18b376744ebcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f9e937484ae5ef284f8d5c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕状况对我再不利，\r\n都没有我跨越不了的高墙……\r\n我始终都是如此坚信着……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a686e47df64f206b8f09e3f8a7708c70294806ba3ebd70ad9b0da67b8cd9b17c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:056b0b6666fb84ed8c911540",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a8e24f90cd4cee7b85d86a761229a975aa6276f070c63c399e4666d3e4647c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3413e9f6f4c5ac2a6542c058",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd39c284289b19c8944436e7ca3b6b2ead589d70912da6f1ecd3665819f7367",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e199c9db4a035adf6f644275",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3713c96a1750274f6bd732c9150deb189f0dd5474989a09adcc4b71f5b95ede7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5fa4c3eb11595621f701d1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "专心……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a2a6717c029fc85251216681e2ce159a1fe024439b8602de2475c220b001c6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe16ca373181338adb07ded5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a0d791ab74893afe99a1e02928b4e17aa608e8354452fd1c3d47bd776bfcf8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:981a6f6bf1ad611285d4faa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "830caf9161b2b303756111c60dd10d4238d8c6540af3fff95df0d3d2c040d17b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:627e68a52c26157b85712165",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来去闲晃一下吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5dfece8c718a86bc4bf2b1c32c6aeb52af71aca7be9e3f4cc523456f8749d9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:226113eb9edb03908fe48b86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是海耶──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56c990857536a850561b9c1e7af4ad3834f83a8334f44a87830d5b2b7359d617",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dea7555ec25e4addac8f33b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这一路上埋首在奔跑中，我很开心哦！\r\n你呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "469b79a9113f2a4b83c762f29655f681a27f9bcf921781fb4cf9ea398958d749",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53c864aa87f9b182b7c1fb47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，我很感谢你喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "617b9a3f6ed8a513563d547b4d593850e6087dad3ba6a5b0dd09ec7bfd38132e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2402283c564df3ce3079676b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟着我来吧──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09628bb8c551aa37e4741570a5f98b8b17f7c20634e758c2f8ef6a35337a89f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e528e5165f2922b9bf333eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽管上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af150512158c10f17b253a8508115348e5a8b75e1756672aed1bd4b1a878783",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8f2b7abe6ba9b8fdad2d3ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟着王牌我一起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c0812ac62a91614f348bf23be5320cb696980a0d6539c2c41e11ad63e7065ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4160b3284b3afb15ac46d29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，我很感谢你喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "617b9a3f6ed8a513563d547b4d593850e6087dad3ba6a5b0dd09ec7bfd38132e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46a731f74b893619967a8ffb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚采访时，\r\n记者问了我的状态跟抱负。\r\n我回答状态很好，敬请期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90efbe82149b953628d565eadefca641460198d023595fdca62c9ff84f780e73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee580c5c8660858a3fad78e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论对手有多强我都求之不得！\r\n肉体和心灵都在熊熊燃烧……\r\n让我恨不得立刻就大显身手一番！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7daa9ad42e8af9910182216faafa93fe716796b578b6d8c57c514a95e7fc6f26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66876fb4fc38588489f12b72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，我很感谢你喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "617b9a3f6ed8a513563d547b4d593850e6087dad3ba6a5b0dd09ec7bfd38132e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45bb99d7fcc8eb94c38456e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくぜっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c11f46b945b8c0a15a10f4699cb1d458f7246ff641f589a27343fad8c54bf0be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e23e7331cb032b1c7db12ed3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊──！就只差那么一点点了耶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13b454bf1a1a14498149eb1df4b4c4820a71908b8b1eb5cfb8c641e0e5b6725c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b6a34526019e01e02e8b290",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈，有够强……令人热血沸腾啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2120640c45e41e50c0171a40185da78aa21afaeda8f9516f9d234f40a190e6a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d31bbb2cba0ed30a63dba4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊啊──！下次一定是我赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "873ca428bee818666e639ea52769181de2170640fec3900f9130e903ea0c29cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afc0b6428e7693c328d63e24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶，我要回去重新锻炼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f9aa45ba9395e641eb5f40efd08c73b7128cedfafc98fe8d5f570292e70bdad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9260258ee3590c7f194952d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跨越高墙！抓住梦想！\r\n来吧，看着「王牌」的背影！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02f24bc61a7a95207cab011eedfea746c1dacbf5e37e873b163eb69d7763acd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1752081e1e1da9e74de5bc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈！好热血的比赛啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42bfa6ba854d38420832dbea9bb6310a49dcd82e603b548d4cf35af4ce822e34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:158f42d935453b40e5f9a54d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "利落地上场啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf4c2f96c3acef5234a468efdfd8a08da56fd07c389d6b4987e07bf83e12c3f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e34d448006a5ddfb0cdb813a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将王牌的英姿烙印在眼底吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d38caccbea4a6dd6d12640f99421dcd6cf07ab7a6113d2f1e9d61dd154906f54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dc36fc155d5dc1047979689",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真没想到千明居然会拜托人啊～\r\n明天可能要下雨啰。\r\n……该不会这正是她的目的吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "531aea8999188767365836a4d91efedcf3bb9b6485026b1f7019c31a76e6abdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:324e65a46a74bebf5d6c39ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "此刻我赌上一切！只为成就叛逆！\r\n我是葛城王牌！！\r\n我会燃烧得比火焰更加炙热！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4485b1629b64063eb7339d50e98adaf20b86ba379d3b3ae6f4e8748ee593d64f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac807514fce7245fda8b6828",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "王牌凯旋归来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "719e2f6811633a52e28fb534d52e667ac08e81ca5aa774cd49f5d3a791ba5f08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bac59f01f364440a1fba87f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你们给我尽情享受吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "387d3ceb796bd9e006fb8fe7afec21f7a0afb3fbb75b9aecadd3e80f34929958",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f11be8a9f4c007e8292907b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着我当上「王牌」的那瞬间吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c797e778083d191e02e6018443132ed8677eca8a3d2882e6c642aa118889d4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98e59185b4b377324eb2c2e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然只身一人做的梦也很不错，\r\n但两人一起追逐超级远大\r\n又火热的梦想……光想就很兴奋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e612297ca3809592c2c7381afa22583fddcc43c517be22cf3dbe18d03d10b4a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0add56a762eeb46d4063a57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套制服真时髦哪～",
      "source_fingerprint": "624053db453896eff8de31f44ab105e2a0d73edb018656f9e42adc6d842808cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d6d1a709a7ca9848d98ac74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "王牌在舞台上的活跃表现\r\n也要尽收眼底啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2193dbbc3771d9eaf8f3c87e67536c6f8a02f8d08fa3371dbe49c5b46baa2fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cde6c7a4033f84125d52d58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "王牌登场！\r\n打起精神上场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b5d3836be3533ed221b3466c1d5584a39434d77cdece95e20080c6ff06bccd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:491dfc130fac56206c345191",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "校规应该禁止把运动裤\r\n穿在裙子底下吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "644c9a30a246b8013b5e74d8da0f0ce549a84305bdcea006218989b0f9e3a211",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:739d53aeb34ddfdd587e5124",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟大家穿一样的衣服是也不错啦……\r\n但能不能在背后刺上刺绣啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ec1fdd5b3e02ccb5f82747e73e1ad506121dc3652489d77a286afa3e4cd023b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f89843ac0e311d436eb343b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，追逐我的背影，\r\n将我的名字铭刻在心中吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1094995df2cb4ef5b5958202576f01190074b176fc919682cd67f1607175f6c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bddaa4649a6dd6563be69416",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦～还有这种的啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c149207cbe058ac65c13f2d3256e34446353c472c071c2fcf55f2d21e86a9065",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d57bbe0871667ddae02dfed6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "麻烦帮我拍张照。\r\n我想寄给父母看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc866f4b6b1a0b561fb07922fb0cdb4b2360071c6fa232ef1854a13ca6b5727",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c778a01e07aee4bb809a906f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ちょっとブラつこうぜ\r\nあんたも来いよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62e3a5ff53be0b83a2ed435f99f916e834882aaa1efcf4c628dc6ab97079dbc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6a61238605a5693cc0b2727",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スカジャンに興味あんのか？\r\n龍派？虎派！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c48b4fcd982bdb2f0eece8becf6ad54639cfb50fb9260927c9e8096ad03a3d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4436651313d122b7d19efeac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套制服真时髦哪～",
      "source_fingerprint": "624053db453896eff8de31f44ab105e2a0d73edb018656f9e42adc6d842808cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cc7bf7f17f0254b7de86d20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "王牌在舞台上的活跃表现\r\n也要尽收眼底啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2193dbbc3771d9eaf8f3c87e67536c6f8a02f8d08fa3371dbe49c5b46baa2fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cb9c02025906ac8e08526cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "王牌登场！\r\n打起精神上场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b5d3836be3533ed221b3466c1d5584a39434d77cdece95e20080c6ff06bccd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80a60bb2450690b46ffb7db3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "校规应该禁止把运动裤\r\n穿在裙子底下吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "644c9a30a246b8013b5e74d8da0f0ce549a84305bdcea006218989b0f9e3a211",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b1c465afdee6d053692f77c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟大家穿一样的衣服是也不错啦……\r\n但能不能在背后刺上刺绣啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ec1fdd5b3e02ccb5f82747e73e1ad506121dc3652489d77a286afa3e4cd023b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9022d5340c84519af5908dec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，追逐我的背影，\r\n将我的名字铭刻在心中吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1094995df2cb4ef5b5958202576f01190074b176fc919682cd67f1607175f6c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a87cba2a8860403772b0ff42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦～还有这种的啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c149207cbe058ac65c13f2d3256e34446353c472c071c2fcf55f2d21e86a9065",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfd1bd7ab4f6024021479438",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "麻烦帮我拍张照。\r\n我想寄给父母看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc866f4b6b1a0b561fb07922fb0cdb4b2360071c6fa232ef1854a13ca6b5727",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4d75c402d28f9f791382898",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2844e10231fb1df80ddf92369741a345d71164ac359effd4df72193851603d28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea6b1767fced58ab61234ec4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊～你今天也很有精神呢！\r\n我也不能输给你。\r\n看我拿出王牌风范，鼓起干劲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8436d836c2b2f6e568a09e63bbac69bff631d0cc3624a55b1a018f1ce1f22f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08c8d6cec794a5fc041166c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我属于起床后能立刻清醒的那种人，\r\n甚至能够起得比鸡还早哦！现在都没\r\n对手可以跟我匹敌了，真没干劲呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c71dc49c1b4fe13550cc5f7c3d715da6a6006b319ec1f139ea029ceab9ce1a81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7862eeb3a551200d2ec4a27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好好吃过饭了吗？还没的话这些\r\n给你！我用老家种的米做了饭团，\r\n但不小心一鼓作气做太多……哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ffd08e4dbe83f101271a403e6950b71a26848e1f4257f9a59a978f493174779",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e03947e08b0c53e32dd92cd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要打倒面前的高墙。\r\n这样才叫王牌啊……嗯。我接受\r\n这份挑战……数学课后辅导……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd121e999421f1554334bec82d418b19353ddf45be8c93bd9e098861e19b99e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ec63cf6ebf604ebc9e8eb61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在家乡时常遇到牛在半夜生产。\r\n这可是件攸关生命的大事，\r\n所以我都会立刻跳下床去帮忙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e351fa5c3347d0f7715d1dd529dabb7b219021757a0c8304d9ef7375a97c89b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd0c12618b3aa1b392bf5820",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "后辈说厕所有鬼出没让她很害怕。\r\n出现在厕所真是太坏心了！\r\n我去骂骂那个鬼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0334eead7a1ee18351a9dc5d9a28bc31918e36dd3f0cf544f882b7c02b6c3fdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb7ae318c3e10d1ce9e405db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在我家乡有条有名的樱花林荫道，\r\n略带深粉色的花朵既鲜艳又耀眼！\r\n看到会让人心情忍不住好起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02d6aa640e0fc0cbe81b4a2224424d59f13aa51407d49d33593e7a94374848b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c3268e5a82d494ba37fe44e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "补充水分之余也别忘了盐分啊～\r\n还要戴帽子，然后再披条毛巾保护好\r\n后颈，在室内也别大意哦？还有……",
      "source_fingerprint": "784c918ac92e34690043b7ef0ed6e4ce0b8c5e6c08982a9d9f96cd907947b6a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2079689d75128f49e394be8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到秋天就想到金黄色的稻田！\r\n结实累累！哎呀～看见那景色就觉得\r\n有回报了～！好期待新米收成啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d62b1081596820e37ea845582ad47067bb68851c0af7841d68881332d8416ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "90008"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
